                  "kind": "markdown",
                  "markdown": "## Built from reusable parts\n\nThe words live in Components. **How** a section looks is chosen where it is placed, so one Component can appear in many places in different ways.\n\n- Change a heading once and every page that uses it follows.\n- Choose the width, the background and the layout per placement.\n- Keep your own content in your own realm; the kit stays read-only."
