                  "content": {
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "kind": "markdown",
                        "markdown": "A renderer reads the Contract of each section and draws it. This sample draws all ten presentations in a light and a dark theme.\n\n| Presentation | Draws |\n|---|---|\n| Hero | a heading, a lead and up to two actions |\n| Grid | its items in a chosen number of columns |"
